@startuml
title Resumefolio | Distributed SRS baseline review
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam activity {
 BackgroundColor #DBEAFE
 BorderColor #64748B
 FontColor #17324D
 DiamondBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
 DiamondBorderColor #B45309
 StartColor #17324D
 EndColor #17324D
}
start
:Identify candidate and accepted scope / constraints;
:Inspect source, user outcomes and primary behavior / quality records;
:Reconcile scenarios, dictionary, identifiers, priorities and traceability;
:Inspect actual dependency findings and unresolved acceptance blockers;
if (Requirements baseline criteria satisfied?) then (yes)
 :Present identifiable candidate and actual evidence to owner;
 :Record actual owner disposition and remaining obligations; <<#DCFCE7>>
else (pending / unmet)
 :Record findings, owner and dependent gates;
 :Revise affected records and recheck; <<#FEF3C7>>
endif
stop
legend bottom
M-02 remains pending; no automatic acceptance follows document completion.
Requirements acceptance is separate from product and release verification.
The wider pre-implementation agreement still precedes coding.
endlegend
@enduml
